0/extras/c6538bbd609072931277fc9815578015.avif?t=1773939968\" width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast world full of dangers hides valuable resources. But remember: the more valuable the loot, the higher the risk. Items do not lie in the same places. Each new world is different from the previous one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/a89db20f8487af12de4099246b8985bc.poster.avif?t=1773939968\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/a89db20f8487af12de4099246b8985bc.webm?t=1773939968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/a89db20f8487af12de4099246b8985bc.mp4?t=1773939968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/7c020105c8463f15eb989acfc94e8b75.avif?t=1773939968\" width=1560 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each weapon is unlike the others. Your arsenal—your rules. Don’t limit yourself to basic stats: find and apply unique modifiers to turn an ordinary gun into the perfect survival tool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/67539a34a31247dc856231a651b56ad8.poster.avif?t=1773939968\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799360/extras/67539a34a31247dc856231a651b56ad8.webm?t=1773939968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/279